    "body": "The existing generator-runtime task has no implementation in accepted source, and its literal effectful-domain placement conflicts with current architecture. This proposal retains all five original definitions of done and the existing3-point task, while explicitly submitting pure portable domain decisions plus an infra lifecycle adapter for planning review. Real acquisition, owned cleanup, failure/async behavior and actual GET /api/admin/config/events nested status remain required; catalog logging does not count as activation.\n\nThe plan identifies the actual tools-route dispatcher-backed response, scoped driver applicability at the existing pinned Katamorph boundary, all start/stop/status arities, disabled/partial/repeated lifecycle behavior, paired-context isolation, authorization negatives, full compiler/lint gates and future whole-live human verification. Placement, driver semantics, async caller propagation and whether the full outcome fits3points are unresolved review decisions before implementation. The corrected plan expressly preserves separately owned161 trusted capability composition, provenance, Discord and no-spawn controls through shared runtime/tools integration, requiring fresh accepted-source/merge guards without adopting its unqualified branch or inventing a hard dependency.\n\nValidation is planning preservation only: independent peer read both full documents, all five original criteria and corrected compatibility;2595 inherited entries remain exact, two receipt/reflection prefixes preserved,28 docs/evidence-only paths and26 lossless streams match hashes. Native owning Rheos readback preserves the original Ready/3-point/full-body task; no card, event, status, config, workflow, source implementation or dependency pin changes. Full25 upstream PR exacthead/base/path comparisons were checked, including one explicitly mapped Git quoted Unicode path; later personalPR6 overlap is acknowledged. The actual immutable current ReceiptRiverAPI validates declared newrow17; all16 inherited rejected rows remain unchanged and are not claimed valid. No backend suite, activation, provider, service or live smoke ran.\n\nThis NEW PR has its own complete persistent Git store/worktree, zero missing objects/alternates/promisor/shared writer object inodes and clean/diffcheck PASS. It stays DRAFT/blocked/auto-merge off behind personal syncPR1. Existing385 eager-caller enforcement,181/182 zero-warning gates, planning decisions, parent and native review qualification remain holds. Native stage metadata supplies no reviewer request/approval/round. Last observed personal CodeRabbit allowance was0 with unknown reset; refreshed allowance is unknown, and no pending request or paid usage is repeated. Development is on the personal fork; final release/deploy integration into origin requires qualified exact evidence.\n\nRelates to https://github.com/open-hax/knoxx/issues/160; does not close it or change its board state. Compatibility reference: https://github.com/riatzukiza/knoxx/pull/6.\n",
